description = "[PAWN_nameDef] had received firearms training, but [PAWN_possessive] work was focused on technical adaptation and manipulation of combat mechanoids on the battlefield.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] developed PTSD after narrowly escaping a primitive firebomb attack in a wheat field. The army medically discharged [PAWN_objective] from service."
